sequenceDiagram
    %% Comments flow 2 of 4 — Opening a thread
    %% Three entry points, one funnel, and the read receipt that follows.
    %% Participants map to:
    %%   NV  ios/RNPdfViewer.swift (RNPdfView)
    %%   SH  ios/CommentSheetView.swift
    %%   JS  src/components/PdfViewer.js
    %%   MS  src/screens/ManuscriptScreen.js
    %%   ST  src/stores/commentsStore.js
    %%   API src/services/commentsService.js
    autonumber
    actor R as Reader
    participant NV as RNPdfView
    participant SH as CommentSheetView
    participant JS as PdfViewer.js
    participant MS as ManuscriptScreen.js
    participant ST as commentsStore
    participant API as commentsService
    participant SRV as Server

    alt tap a gutter dot
        R->>NV: handleGutterTap, anchorKey from accessibilityIdentifier
    else JS drives it, e.g. from a notification
        MS->>NV: openThreadKey prop
    else tap the header bubble icon
        R->>NV: readerHeaderDidTapComment
        Note over NV: Reuses the page-level thread if one exists,<br/>otherwise opens a .draft with empty anchorText
    end

    NV->>NV: openThread(anchorKey)
    NV->>NV: scrollTo(anchorKey), go(to: selection) or go(to: page)
    NV->>SH: open(target: .thread(anchorKey))

    SH->>SH: reset replyTo, expanded, composer text, scroll offset
    SH->>SH: render
    SH->>SH: thread = target.resolve(in: threads)
    SH->>SH: header = "N comments, Page X", quote block, room chip
    SH->>SH: rebuildList(comments)
    Note over SH: All roots, first 2 replies each,<br/>"N more replies" button for the rest
    SH->>R: slide container up over 0.28s

    NV->>JS: onThreadOpened(anchorKey)
    JS->>MS: onThreadOpened(anchorKey)
    MS->>ST: markThreadRead(bookId, anchorKey)
    ST->>ST: set read=true, unreadCount=0, recount book total
    ST-->>MS: byBook updated
    MS->>NV: threads + unreadTotal props
    NV->>NV: refreshOverlays redraws dot smaller and untinted
    NV->>SH: update then render, unread dots clear

    ST->>API: markCommentsRead(roomId, bookId, ids)
    API->>SRV: POST /room/{roomId}/book/{bookId}/comments/read
    Note over ST,SRV: Fire and forget. Dots are already clear locally,<br/>a lost receipt costs a reappearing dot, not correctness
